# Pattern store & capability index — live data, not source (2026-07 decision).
# patterns.json: the SQLite store (.remembrance/*.db) is the live backend;
#   this file is its cross-session export. It grew in git history every
#   session; now untracked. Fresh clones seed from seeds/ + `oracle init`
#   auto-import; cross-machine durability via `oracle sync push` (personal
#   store). Re-track deliberately if a versioned corpus snapshot is wanted.
# ecosystem-capabilities.json: fully regenerable —
#   node scripts/build-capability-index.js
patterns.json
ecosystem-capabilities.json
